/// M30 HISTORY-045 "Guide anchors: files plus markers".
/// Source: tests/baseline/t26_product_guide_test.go symbol
/// TestT26ProductGuideCoversContracts (L30-130) anchor
/// map (L87-117).
/// Disposition: historical_candidate (this row pins the
/// TestT26ProductGuideCoversContracts offline pact as
/// reviewable Can facts; the old Go check stays until
/// the integrator retires it after every linked row,
/// variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the cited anchor pairs as the
/// green root: the eight anchor files in Go order, the
/// thirteen retained markers in Go order, and the two
/// anchor totals.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): file pins
/// hold the map key bytes; marker pins hold the inner
/// bytes with newline escapes kept. anchor-file-stream
/// pins stream file (L88); anchor-file-invoice-contract
/// pins invoice file (L92); anchor-file-form pins form
/// file (L97); anchor-file-action-json pins action file
/// (L101); anchor-file-schema pins schema file (L104);
/// anchor-file-shutdown pins shutdown file (L108);
/// anchor-file-catalogue pins catalogue file (L111);
/// anchor-file-readme pins readme file (L114);
/// marker-close-reader pins close_reader (L89);
/// marker-never-primary pins never plus primary (L90);
/// marker-load-grid pins load grid line (L93);
/// marker-save-grid pins save grid line (L94);
/// marker-save-html pins save html line (L95);
/// marker-max-rows pins max rows 64 (L98);
/// marker-max-row-bytes pins max row bytes 2048 (L99);
